(For most purposes ''ratcykai mlatu'' seems sufficient.)

ro brode broda cu broda .iku'i lo mabrnmustela na mlatu

(''ratcykai mlatykai''.)

Valid, though you won't catch me using it. :) ''mabrnmustela'' is easier to remember, for me.

